BT /F1 16 Tf 54 750 Td (4.5 Levels of organization) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 724 Td (In many-celled organisms, cells are organized in levels:) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 709 Td (cells -> tissues -> organs -> organ systems -> organism.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 694 Td (Example: muscle cells form muscle tissue; muscle tissue, with other tissues, forms the heart \(an organ\);) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 679 Td (the heart and blood vessels form the circulatory system.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 664 Td () Tj ET
