BT /F1 11 Tf 54 623 Td (1. Which part of the cell theory did Virchow add?) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 608 Td (2. Name two structures found in plant cells but not in animal cells.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 593 Td (3. Why do muscle cells have many mitochondria?) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 578 Td (4. Put these in order from smallest to largest: organ, cell, organ system, tissue.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 563 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 548 Td (Vocabulary: cell, cell theory, organelle, nucleus, membrane, cytoplasm, mitochondria, chloroplast,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 533 Td (cell wall, vacuole, ribosome, prokaryote, eukaryote, tissue, organ, organ system) Tj ET
